{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HAB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"哈巴谷書","commonName":"哈巴谷書","title":"哈巴谷書","order":35,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"3950aea0497fecb9919bc35f98267a809e40b7449cd14053bf8d5ff0dbd8ea3b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":56},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我要登上瞭望台，",{"text":"站在望樓上守候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看耶和華要對我說什麼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要怎樣向祂分訴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華的答覆"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和華對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「將我的啟示記下來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清楚地刻在板上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便於人們閱讀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這啟示還未到實現之時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它關乎結局，沒有虛假。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使緩慢，也要等候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這事終必發生，不再遲延。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看那驕傲之人，他們心術不正，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但義人必靠信心","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"而活。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"財富","poem":1},{"noteId":2},{"text":"會欺騙驕傲之人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們永不安分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像陰間一樣貪得無厭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如死亡一般永不滿足。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他們征服萬國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擄掠萬民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"「但萬國萬民必用詩歌和俗語嘲諷他們，說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『你們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們吞沒別人的財產，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"靠剝削別人囤積財富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要到何時呢？』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的債主必突然行動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們戰戰兢兢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"淪為他們的俘虜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們從前擄掠許多國家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀他們的土地、城市和人民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以各國的餘民必掠奪你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「為自己的家積蓄不義之財、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在高處搭窩躲避災禍的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們陰謀毀滅各族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致自辱己家，自害己命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牆上的石頭必高聲控訴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"房子的梁木必同聲響應。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"「以人血建城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以罪惡造城池的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦的勞碌都化為灰燼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國的辛勞盡是虛空。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這不都是出於萬軍之耶和華嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為大地必充滿對耶和華之榮耀的認識，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同海洋被水充滿。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「讓鄰居喝酒直到灌醉他們，好觀看他們祼體的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們有禍了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必飽受羞辱，毫無榮耀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們喝吧，露出下體吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華右手中的杯將傳給你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的榮耀將變成羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們以暴虐對待黎巴嫩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己必被暴虐吞噬；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們毀滅野獸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己必被恐怖籠罩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們殺人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毀土地、城市和人民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"「雕刻的偶像有什麼益處？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"騙人的鑄像有什麼用處？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"製造者竟信靠自己造的啞巴偶像！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對木頭說『醒醒吧』，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對啞巴石頭說『起來吧』的人啊，你們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它們能教導你們嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，它們外面包金裹銀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"裡面卻毫無生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華住在祂的聖殿中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人都要在祂面前肅靜。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「信心」或譯「忠信」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":4}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"「財富」參照死海古卷，多個希伯來抄本為「酒」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HAB/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}